    panel: 'rgba(29, 96, 34, .95)',
  }}
  overview={{
    html: '<p>Relatient is a leading patient engagement platform, helping hospitals, health systems, and medical offices reach their patients at every point of the patient journey with mobile-first solutions like appointment reminders, patient self-scheduling, digital registration and patient intake, patient surveys, health campaigns, and digital billing. Relatient has over 100 employees and is based in Franklin, TN, USA.</p>',
    logo: { src: '/images/2023/06/Relatient.png', w: 228, h: 71, alt: 'Relatient logo' },
  }}
  testimonial={{
    text: 'Prasanna and the team at RiseOak have been key to helping us hit our SEO goals more quickly than we could have done alone by increasing the reach of our existing content and working closely with our Content Manager to create a plan for new content that meets SEO and campaign goals. Following their SEO recommendations has proved effective for developing content that ranks very quickly, often earning us the first place in Google search results and even a few featured snippets. The growth in organic traffic is so important because these leads are more likely to convert to customers and organic rankings further position us as the authority in our space. RiseOak has been a perfect complement to our team.',
